Lobium — Android mobile persona parity for desktop-hosted emulation.

Desktop Chromium exposes its built-in PDF plugin list. Real Android Chromium does not expose that
desktop plugin surface. When the native config declares uaMobile, suppress the fixed PDF plugins and
pdfViewerEnabled so navigator.plugins/mimeTypes agree with the Android persona.

